{"id":"n78312-1-7","stage":4,"title":"참맛 · 真味","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n78312-1-7-1","ko":"된장찌개 맛이 어떠니?","zh":"大酱汤味道怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"된장찌개","meaning":"韩式大酱汤","explanation":"된장찌개：韩式大酱汤。","readings":[{"term":"된장찌개","audio":"/audio/fa09ba8b4950af996222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14930","senseId":"1","lemma":"된장찌개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된장찌개","audio":"/audio/fa09ba8b4950af996222.mp3"}},{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛이","audio":"/audio/967e9ccf650ca1244186.mp3"}},{"text":"어떠니?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떠니","audio":"/audio/32c98435bf98440b11d6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fa09ba8b4950af99","term":"된장찌개","zh":"韩式大酱汤","audio":"/audio/fa09ba8b4950af996222.mp3","entryId":"14930","definition":"将大酱拌入水中，并放入葱、西葫芦、豆腐等食材后煮制而成的浓汤。","pronunciation":["된ː장찌개","뒌ː장찌개"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/369f67631e1b971dfedc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78312-1-7-2","ko":"된장의 참맛이 잘 살아 있어서 구수하고 맛있어요.","zh":"充分保留了大酱的本味，醇香又好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"된장의","meaning":"大酱","explanation":"된장：大酱；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"된장","audio":"/audio/83704f823568fd14d4d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48241","senseId":"1","lemma":"된장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"된장의","audio":"/audio/016c681d7ef9232bfe60.mp3"}},{"text":"참맛이","meaning":"真味，原味","explanation":"참맛：真味，原味；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"참맛","audio":"/audio/018db33f78574e857263.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78312","senseId":"1","lemma":"참맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참맛이","audio":"/audio/5101f54a198e357c4037.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"살아","meaning":"活生生，生动，维持","explanation":"살다：活生生，生动，维持；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"4","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살아","audio":"/audio/30d811da4a1eb958a364.mp3"}},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어서","audio":"/audio/8c518243ad11245b602e.mp3"}},{"text":"구수하고","meaning":"香喷喷","explanation":"구수하다：香喷喷；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"구수하다","audio":"/audio/af80e1efed69af0a85a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36371","senseId":"1","lemma":"구수하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구수하고","audio":"/audio/bfbac36bbaea0a303b38.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있어요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛있어요","audio":"/audio/d2df2197e887a0da537c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"83704f823568fd14","term":"된장","zh":"大酱","audio":"/audio/83704f823568fd14d4d2.mp3","entryId":"48241","definition":"把做酱油后剩下的酱曲子经发酵而制成的酱。","pronunciation":["된ː장","뒌ː장"]},{"id":"018db33f78574e85","term":"참맛","zh":"真味，原味","audio":"/audio/018db33f78574e857263.mp3","entryId":"78312","definition":"本来的味道。","pronunciation":["참맏"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"活生生，生动，维持","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"原本的颜色或特征等清楚地显露出来。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"af80e1efed69af0a","term":"구수하다","zh":"香喷喷","audio":"/audio/af80e1efed69af0a85a3.mp3","entryId":"36371","definition":"跟大麦茶、锅巴水、大酱汤等里喷出的味道一样香。","pronunciation":["구수하다"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/93b5ecde5165ea8bcc4d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78312","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":132,"sequenceScore":2.5167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["大酱汤味道怎么样？","充分保留了大酱的本味，醇香又好吃。","你听到油价暴跌的消息了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["大酱汤味道怎么样？","充分保留了大酱的本味，醇香又好吃。","你听到油价暴跌的消息了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
